2026-09-23 harness audit: SingleSource/lit.local.cfg sets traditional_output
true, so upstream timeit DOES append exit status before hashing. The earlier
claim that appending it was itself wrong is withdrawn. The corrected timing
attempt above still establishes all three child timeouts, but its output
comparisons are not acceptance evidence. New passing runs must preserve the
full original output contract; block-local-pure-reuse.out records that replay.
